             :intent "A namespace docstring's citations are not definition references: `seon.fn/references-by-caller` unions only var definitions' docstrings (`seon.ref/names`), and the `:seon.ns/ns` row declares no `:seon.fn/references`. Done when the indexer writes the qualified symbols a namespace's docstring cites (clj-kondo's namespace definition doc, never itself) into the existing `:seon.fn/references` on its `:seon.ns/name` entity, declared on that row with no new attribute, and test reach follows them; measure selected test counts before and after. Deftests already carry `:seon.fn/references` on the `:seon.test/test` row through the same union."}]
